  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in a multiprofile/avgpool setup, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5305 and F1 of 0.5152, lower than the scvi_n200 baseline (0.6501/0.6275). The result suggests the RNA encoder choice may influence performance, though uncertainty remains about other factors like data context or aggregation methods not isolated in this comparison."
